WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.360
Fictional example: Apple notices the fill line. Pause the affected task; never compress contents or use ordinary waste.

2
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:20.300
Choose controls for the route: hands, ventilation, safe waste and bite prevention. Gloves do not replace hand hygiene.

3
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:29.440
Adjust bag, chair and supplies. Seek help, take breaks and report pain; do not force painful movement.

4
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:39.460
Apple says, “I am exhausted; I need support and a safe route.” Verify the alternative; extra hours are not the default control.

5
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:52.000
Five pairs: sharps, infection, body, stress and accidents. Correct mismatched controls. If essential protection is missing, pause and seek correction.

6
00:00:52.300 --> 00:01:03.660
Apple matches the hazard to the control and requests authorized replacement. Resume only after verified correction; if uncertain, keep the task paused.
